flowchart TB
  REST[REST API Spring MVC]

  REST --> CTRL[Controller Layer]
  CTRL --> RC[RestController]
  CTRL --> RM[RequestMapping]
  RM --> GET[GetMapping]
  RM --> POST[PostMapping]
  RM --> PUT[PutMapping]
  RM --> DEL[DeleteMapping]
  RM --> PATCH[PatchMapping]

  REST --> PARAMS[Parameter Extraction]
  PARAMS --> PV[PathVariable]
  PARAMS --> RP[RequestParam]
  PARAMS --> RH[RequestHeader]
  PARAMS --> RB[RequestBody]
  PARAMS --> RA[RequestAttribute]
  PARAMS --> MV[MatrixVariable]

  REST --> RESP[Response Building]
  RESP --> RS[ResponseStatus]
  RESP --> RE[ResponseEntity]
  RESP --> RSE[ResponseStatusException]
  RESP --> HEADERS[HttpHeaders]

  REST --> CONEG[Content Negotiation]
  CONEG --> CN[ContentNegotiationConfigurer]
  CONEG --> JSON[JSON]
  CONEG --> XML[XML]

  REST --> HATEOAS[Spring HATEOAS]
  HATEOAS --> RMOD[RepresentationModel]
  HATEOAS --> EM[EntityModel]
  HATEOAS --> CM[CollectionModel]
  HATEOAS --> LINK[Link / WebMvcLinkBuilder]

  REST --> CORS[CORS Configuration]
  CORS --> CROSS[CrossOrigin]
  CORS --> GCC[GlobalCorsConfiguration]

  REST --> VERSION[API Versioning]
  VERSION --> URI[URI Path]
  VERSION --> PARAM[Parameter]
  VERSION --> HEADER[Header]
  VERSION --> CT[Content Type]

  REST --> BEST[REST Best Practices]
  BEST --> PAGIN[Pagination / Pageable]
  BEST --> SORT[Sorting]
  BEST --> FILTER[Filtering]
  BEST --> ETAG[ETags]
  BEST --> IDEMP[Idempotency]
